[{"category":"section","location":"#GriddingMachine","page":"Home","text":"Global datasets to feed Emerald and CliMA Land.","title":"GriddingMachine"},{"category":"section","location":"#Install-and-use","page":"Home","text":"using Pkg;\nPkg.add(\"GriddingMachine\");","title":"Install and use"},{"category":"section","location":"#Tutorials","page":"Home","text":"Other than the API documentation, some tutorials are provided in our online tutorial blogs.","title":"Tutorials"},{"category":"section","location":"API/#API","page":"API","text":"The paper-facing workflow uses Collector for catalog-backed local data management and Indexer for unified NetCDF access. Server and Requestor remain compatibility modules but are outside the updated workflow described here.","title":"API"},{"category":"section","location":"API/#Collector","page":"API","text":"Collector keeps the external YAML catalog separate from package releases. Package loading does not contact the network; call load_database! for a local catalog or update_database! to fetch and transactionally replace it.","title":"Collector"},{"category":"section","location":"API/#Indexer","page":"API","text":"","title":"Indexer"},{"category":"section","location":"API/#Requestor","page":"API","text":"","title":"Requestor"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.configure!","page":"API","text":"Configure the local data root and external catalog without performing network I/O.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.configure!"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.load_database!","page":"API","text":"Load and validate the local catalog, downloading it only when explicitly needed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.load_database!"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.update_database!","page":"API","text":"Download a validated catalog and atomically make it the active in-memory state.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.update_database!"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.clean_database!","page":"API","text":"Remove old or all downloaded datasets under the configured isolated data root.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.clean_database!"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.sync_database!","page":"API","text":"Update the catalog and synchronize selected tags (all tags by default).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.sync_database!"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.download_dataset!","page":"API","text":"Download a NetCDF through mirror fallback and promote it only after integrity checks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.download_dataset!"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.dataset_info","page":"API","text":"Return a copy of the validated catalog metadata for one dataset tag.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.dataset_info"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Collector.verify_dataset_file","page":"API","text":"Check an existing file against the optional SIZE and SHA256 catalog fields.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Collector.verify_dataset_file"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Indexer.lat_ind","page":"API","text":"Return the 1-based latitude-cell index for a regular global grid.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Indexer.lat_ind"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Indexer.lon_ind","page":"API","text":"Return the 1-based longitude-cell index, wrapping longitudes outside [-180, 180].\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Indexer.lon_ind"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Indexer.read_dataset","page":"API","text":"Read an entire local NetCDF file or a catalog dataset tag.\n\n\n\n\n\nRead one 1-based cycle from a local NetCDF file or catalog dataset tag.\n\n\n\n\n\nRead all cycles at the grid cell containing (lat, lon).\n\n\n\n\n\nRead one cycle at the grid cell containing (lat, lon).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Indexer.read_dataset"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Indexer.read_LUT","page":"API","text":"Compatibility alias retained for code written against GriddingMachine 0.4.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Indexer.read_LUT"},{"category":"function","location":"API/#GriddingMachine.Requestor.request_site_data","page":"API","text":"request_site_data(server::String, user::String, tag::String, lat::Number, lon::Number, cycle::Int = 0)\n\nSend a request to the specified server to get the artifact data for the given location, given\n\nserver the server URL (e.g., \"http://localhost:8000\")\nuser the user name\ntag the artifact tag (e.g., \"LM4X1Y_V1\")\nlat the target latitude\nlon the target longitude\ncycle the data cycle number (0 for all cycles, default is 0)\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"GriddingMachine.Requestor.request_site_data"}]
